### Health check
GET http://localhost:8666/api/health

### Create a household member
POST http://localhost:8666/api/household-member
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "countryOfResidence": "Switzerland",
  "countryOfEmployment": "Switzerland",
  "averageMonthlySalary": 6000.00,
  "currentCash": 15000.00
}

### List household members
GET http://localhost:8666/api/household-member

### Create an expense
POST http://localhost:8666/api/expense
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "month": "JULY",
  "label": "Electricity bill",
  "expenseType": "MONTHLY",
  "expenseSheetId": 1
}

### List expenses
GET http://localhost:8666/api/expenses

### Create an expense sheet
POST http://localhost:8666/api/expense-sheet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sheetName": "Sept budget",
  "owner": "admin"
}

### List expense sheets for an owner
GET http://localhost:8666/api/expense-sheets?owner=admin
